# 0005 plugin: port the 0.0.35 Metal plugin to the XeMTL driver for the Intel Xe GPU
#
# Base:  NvGfx xe 497d521e925bd760c8cde5bbc17d9bf96d2ee2b4 (XeGfx 0.0.35), plugin/
# Apply: patch -p1 --remove-empty-files < patches/0005-plugin-xemtl-port.patch
#
# This is the earlier project phase: the NVIDIA Metal plugin of NvGfx 0.0.35 renamed for the
# Intel stack (class and symbol prefixes NVMTL -> XeMTL, NVMTLDevice -> XeMTLDevice, environment
# and bundle paths /Library/GPUBundles/nvmtl -> /Library/GPUBundles/xemtl, vendor ids and device
# names for the Intel Xe GPU), with the XR pixel formats mapped onto Vulkan formats here.
# Most of the changed lines are that mechanical renaming; the plugin tree was never rebased to
# NvGfx 0.0.44, so patches 0006 and 0007 continue from this tree and not from 0.0.44.
#

